@owner: mason
@stability: stable
@since: 2026-06-09
@reviewed: 2026-06-09

Feature: Share Info Command
  "CLI handler for mason info: detailed view of one share by object path or s/slug ref."

  Provides:
    - cli.newInfoCommand @source("symbol:newInfoCommand")
    - cli.resolveShareRef @source("symbol:resolveShareRef")
    - cli.defaultReadRun @source("symbol:defaultReadRun")

  Consumes:
    - cli.defaultLsRun
    - domain.ParseRef
    - domain.Manifest
    - output.NewError

  Invariants:
    - resolveShareRef MUST accept object paths and s/slug refs consistently with remote-link commands
    - Unknown refs MUST surface as usage_error
    - JSON output MUST include per-endpoint state and blob reference count

  Scenario (happy-path): Info by object path
    Given a manifest containing the path
    When mason info super/rad/foo.mp3 runs
    Then endpoint states, URLs, and blob refs are printed

  Scenario (happy-path): Info by slug ref
    Given s/f76 resolves to a share
    When mason info s/f76 runs
    Then the same detail view is shown

  Scenario (negative): Unknown ref
    Given a ref not in the manifest
    When mason info runs
    Then a usage_error is returned
